{"id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#thm:riemannian-manifolds-metric-spaces","title":"thm:riemannian-manifolds-metric-spaces","path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.md","line":2380,"body":"","kind":"theorem","status":"not_started","tex":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex#thm:riemannian-manifolds-metric-spaces","uses":["[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:riemannian-distance]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:riemannian-distance-finite]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:riemannian-distance-symm]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:riemannian-distance-triangle]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:riemannian-distance-locally-small]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:riemannian-distance-small-implies-nearby]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","label":"thm:riemannian-manifolds-metric-spaces","line":3868,"source":"\\begin{theorem}[Riemannian Manifolds as Metric Spaces]\n\\label{thm:riemannian-manifolds-metric-spaces}\n\n\\uses{def:riemannian-distance, prop:riemannian-distance-finite, lem:riemannian-distance-symm, lem:riemannian-distance-triangle, lem:riemannian-distance-locally-small, lem:riemannian-distance-small-implies-nearby}\n\n\\dcref{ch2:2.55}\n\n\n\nEvery connected Riemannian manifold with or without boundary carries the metric-space structure determined below. Its distance is $d_g$ by Lemma \\ref{lem:riemannian-metric-space-dist}, and its topology is the manifold topology by Theorem \\ref{thm:riemannian-distance-topology}.\n\\end{theorem}\n\\begin{proof}\n\n\\uses{prop:riemannian-distance-finite,lem:riemannian-distance-symm,lem:riemannian-distance-triangle,lem:riemannian-distance-locally-small,lem:riemannian-distance-small-implies-nearby}\n\\sketch Nonnegativity and $d_g(p,p)=0$ follow from the definition; symmetry is Lemma \\ref{lem:riemannian-distance-symm} and the triangle inequality is Lemma \\ref{lem:riemannian-distance-triangle}. If $p\\ne q$, choose an open neighborhood $U$ of $p$ excluding $q$; Lemma \\ref{lem:riemannian-distance-small-implies-nearby} gives $c>0$ whose $d_g$-ball lies in $U$, hence $d_g(p,q)\\ge c$. Proposition \\ref{prop:riemannian-distance-finite} makes the extended distance real-valued.\n\\end{proof}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Theorem</div></section>[Riemannian Manifolds as Metric Spaces] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-74686d3a7269656d616e6e69616e2d6d616e69666f6c64732d6d65747269632d737061636573\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Ariemannian-distance\">↗ def:riemannian-distance</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Ariemannian-distance-finite\">↗ prop:riemannian-distance-finite</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Ariemannian-distance-symm\">↗ lem:riemannian-distance-symm</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Ariemannian-distance-triangle\">↗ lem:riemannian-distance-triangle</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Ariemannian-distance-locally-small\">↗ lem:riemannian-distance-locally-small</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Ariemannian-distance-small-implies-nearby\">↗ lem:riemannian-distance-small-implies-nearby</a> <p></p><span class=\"tex-source-references\" role=\"list\" style=\"display:block\"><span class=\"tex-dcref\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"display:block\">1. ch2:2.55</span></span><p></p>Every connected Riemannian manifold with or without boundary carries the metric-space structure determined below. Its distance is <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$d_g$\">$d_g$</span> by Lemma <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Ariemannian-metric-space-dist\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:riemannian-metric-space-dist\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a7269656d616e6e69616e2d6d65747269632d73706163652d64697374\">2</a>, and its topology is the manifold topology by Theorem <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23thm%3Ariemannian-distance-topology\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#thm:riemannian-distance-topology\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-74686d3a7269656d616e6e69616e2d64697374616e63652d746f706f6c6f6779\">2</a>.  <section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Ariemannian-distance-finite\">↗ prop:riemannian-distance-finite</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Ariemannian-distance-symm\">↗ lem:riemannian-distance-symm</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Ariemannian-distance-triangle\">↗ lem:riemannian-distance-triangle</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Ariemannian-distance-locally-small\">↗ lem:riemannian-distance-locally-small</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Ariemannian-distance-small-implies-nearby\">↗ lem:riemannian-distance-small-implies-nearby</a> \\sketch Nonnegativity and <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$d_g(p,p)=0$\">$d_g(p,p)=0$</span> follow from the definition; symmetry is Lemma <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Ariemannian-distance-symm\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:riemannian-distance-symm\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a7269656d616e6e69616e2d64697374616e63652d73796d6d\">15</a> and the triangle inequality is Lemma <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Ariemannian-distance-triangle\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:riemannian-distance-triangle\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a7269656d616e6e69616e2d64697374616e63652d747269616e676c65\">15</a>. If <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$p\\ne q$\">$p\\ne q$</span>, choose an open neighborhood <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$U$\">$U$</span> of <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$p$\">$p$</span> excluding <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$q$\">$q$</span>; Lemma <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Ariemannian-distance-small-implies-nearby\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:riemannian-distance-small-implies-nearby\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a7269656d616e6e69616e2d64697374616e63652d736d616c6c2d696d706c6965732d6e6561726279\">15</a> gives <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$c&gt;0$\">$c&gt;0$</span> whose <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$d_g$\">$d_g$</span>-ball lies in <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$U$\">$U$</span>, hence <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$d_g(p,q)\\ge c$\">$d_g(p,q)\\ge c$</span>. Proposition <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Ariemannian-distance-finite\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:riemannian-distance-finite\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-70726f703a7269656d616e6e69616e2d64697374616e63652d66696e697465\">15</a> makes the extended distance real-valued. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:distance-comparison-neighborhood","next":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:riemannian-metric-space-dist","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:riemannian-distance","title":"def:riemannian-distance","label":"def:riemannian-distance"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:riemannian-distance-finite","title":"prop:riemannian-distance-finite","label":"prop:riemannian-distance-finite"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:riemannian-distance-symm","title":"lem:riemannian-distance-symm","label":"lem:riemannian-distance-symm"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:riemannian-distance-triangle","title":"lem:riemannian-distance-triangle","label":"lem:riemannian-distance-triangle"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:riemannian-distance-locally-small","title":"lem:riemannian-distance-locally-small","label":"lem:riemannian-distance-locally-small"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:riemannian-distance-small-implies-nearby","title":"lem:riemannian-distance-small-implies-nearby","label":"lem:riemannian-distance-small-implies-nearby"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:riemannian-metric-space-dist","title":"lem:riemannian-metric-space-dist","label":"lem:riemannian-metric-space-dist"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#thm:riemannian-distance-topology","title":"thm:riemannian-distance-topology","label":"thm:riemannian-distance-topology"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#thm:riemannian-manifolds-metric-spaces","title":"thm:riemannian-manifolds-metric-spaces","tex":"\\begin{theorem}[Riemannian Manifolds as Metric Spaces]\n\\label{thm:riemannian-manifolds-metric-spaces}\n\n\\uses{def:riemannian-distance, prop:riemannian-distance-finite, lem:riemannian-distance-symm, lem:riemannian-distance-triangle, lem:riemannian-distance-locally-small, lem:riemannian-distance-small-implies-nearby}\n\n\\dcref{ch2:2.55}\n\n\n\nEvery connected Riemannian manifold with or without boundary carries the metric-space structure determined below. Its distance is $d_g$ by Lemma \\ref{lem:riemannian-metric-space-dist}, and its topology is the manifold topology by Theorem \\ref{thm:riemannian-distance-topology}.\n\\end{theorem}\n\\begin{proof}\n\n\\uses{prop:riemannian-distance-finite,lem:riemannian-distance-symm,lem:riemannian-distance-triangle,lem:riemannian-distance-locally-small,lem:riemannian-distance-small-implies-nearby}\n\\sketch Nonnegativity and $d_g(p,p)=0$ follow from the definition; symmetry is Lemma \\ref{lem:riemannian-distance-symm} and the triangle inequality is Lemma \\ref{lem:riemannian-distance-triangle}. If $p\\ne q$, choose an open neighborhood $U$ of $p$ excluding $q$; Lemma \\ref{lem:riemannian-distance-small-implies-nearby} gives $c>0$ whose $d_g$-ball lies in $U$, hence $d_g(p,q)\\ge c$. Proposition \\ref{prop:riemannian-distance-finite} makes the extended distance real-valued.\n\\end{proof}","source":"tex/references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","description":"","dependencies":[{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:riemannian-distance","title":"def:riemannian-distance","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:riemannian-distance-finite","title":"prop:riemannian-distance-finite","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:riemannian-distance-symm","title":"lem:riemannian-distance-symm","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:riemannian-distance-triangle","title":"lem:riemannian-distance-triangle","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:riemannian-distance-locally-small","title":"lem:riemannian-distance-locally-small","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:riemannian-distance-small-implies-nearby","title":"lem:riemannian-distance-small-implies-nearby","description":""}],"dependencies_omitted":0,"unresolved_dependencies":[],"unresolved_omitted":0}}